If an assertion fails while a host is live, retain the evidence, submit `/quit` to each responsive owned host, wait for shell return, and run `cleanup_owned_root` only after its exact host group has exited. Never substitute a signal or tab close for normal exit. If normal exit cannot be proved, leave that owned root/tab identified for rework rather than deleting under a live process.

